    · exact (hun 112 (by omega) (by decide) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega)).trans hF
    · exact (hun 108 (by omega) (by decide) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega)).trans hc
    · exact (hu.real_frame (setup_real_frame 70 (by omega) (by decide) (by omega) (by omega))).trans hd
    · exact (hun 96 (by omega) (by decide) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega) (by omega)).trans hptr
